dot/pulls/120764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120764","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120764.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120764.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-19T22:21:38Z"},"body":"Since we need to allocate USERDATA2 to remember the color, this functionality is hidden behind a flag, to avoid growing the memory footprint of particles for everyone, since this is a pretty niche usecase.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76360\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWhile particles already have a way to know if color needs to be restarted or not, particle process recalculates the color every frame.\r\nSince we use color over life curves and such, we need to store the start color and recalculate every frame the color based on the starting one and the color curves.\r\n\r\nThis is hidden behind a flag because not many use emit_subparticle with color. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng